  "description": "Upgrade your truck with OEDRO Drop Running Boards — the perfect blend of style, strength, and convenience. Designed for the 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab & 2020-2026 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab , these heavy-duty carbon steel side steps provide effortless access, superior protection, and rugged appeal for everyday driving or off-road adventures.\nFeatures\n6-inch side pedals.: The two-level layout provides better convenience for vehicles equipped with lifting kits and oversized tires.\nTwo-Stair Platform design: The 2-tube and Two Stairs Design Platform design provides more protection for the bottom and sides of the vehicle while preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker or hanging obstacles.\nBolt-fixed installation: Welded brackets provide extra strength without cutting or drilling.\nStrong and sturdy: The unique powder coating has anti-rust and corrosion resistance, so it can be driven under any conditions.\nEasy Entry: Features a unique dual-step layout that provides safe and convenient access for passengers of all ages and helps load or unload gear from the roof.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2019-2026 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 1500 Crew Cab\nCompatible with 2020-2026 Chevy Silverado GMC Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab",
  "highlights": [
    "Convenient Two-Step Platform: The dual-step design offers added stepping support for easier vehicle access, while providing a stable foothold when loading roof cargo or cleaning your vehicle.",
    "High Load Capacity & Rugged Protection: Engineered with a sturdy tubular structure to support heavy loads while adding side protection against rocks, debris, and everyday impacts.",
    "Enhanced Stability & Vehicle Protection: The drop-step design creates a wider stepping area and helps protect rocker panels from obstacles during off-road driving and daily use."
  ],
